request.description:
Callback otomatis dari Google setelah user consent.
Script test akan otomatis simpan access_token & refresh_token ke collection variables.

Response 200:
{
  status, message,
  data: { accessToken, refreshToken, user: { id, name, email, avatar_url } }
}

